							<div class=" wh_topic_content body ">
    <h1 class="title topictitle1">Intrusion Detection</h1>


<div class="body taskbody"><p class="shortdesc">Intrusion detection function detects people, vehicles or other objects that
        enter and loiter in a pre-defined virtual region. Specific actions can be taken when an
        alarm is triggered.</p>

<ol class="ol steps" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-D2478373-1DC1-46E4-A2ED-B3F2DD6C2CA7"><li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-1CFE0692-DECF-46BC-B3DC-3BD0019BFB7A">
                <span class="ph cmd">Go to <span class="ph menucascade"><span class="ph uicontrol">Smart Analysis</span> &gt; <span class="ph uicontrol">Smart Event Settings</span> &gt; <span class="ph uicontrol">Perimeter Protection</span></span>.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-67BE4982-D9C7-49B5-A377-E7BC4DCCCDC0">
                <span class="ph cmd">Select a camera.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-DDC7142D-380C-4AB6-B522-18DFD5CBFF37">
                <span class="ph cmd">Click <span class="ph uicontrol">Intrusion</span>.</span>
                <div class="itemgroup info">
                    <div class="fig fignone" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__FIG_SXT_DZN_CJB">
                        
                        <img class="image" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__IMAGE_NZ5_SNX_TJB" src="GUID-9CF9454F-DF51-4EB3-B7F6-6772E0856F45-high.png" width="2000" />
                    <span class="figcap">Figure 1 Intrusion
                            Detection</span></div>

                </div>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-C32E28AA-AACA-4D48-A824-40832D46C81C">
                <span class="ph cmd">Check <span class="ph uicontrol">Enable Intrusion Detection</span>.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-37251089-9EF0-49BD-8FD4-7D349E0DC41A"><strong>Optional: </strong>
                <span class="ph cmd">Check <span class="ph uicontrol">Save VCA Picture</span> to save the captured intrusion
                    detection pictures.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-E0B36222-F952-4B7F-AF51-79F42FDD1CEE">
                <span class="ph cmd">Set the detection rules and detection areas.</span>
                <ol type="a" class="ol substeps" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__SUBSTEPS_SXW_JZN_CJB">
                    <li class="li substep substepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-5852F8D6-8932-42F6-B17C-74BBA3E6E8D7">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Select a virtual panel. Up to 4 virtual panels are selectable.</span>
                    </li>

                    <li class="li substep substepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-CC0894C3-CC0B-4369-A422-BBFED661096D">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Set <span class="keyword parmname">Time Threshold</span>, and
                                <span class="keyword parmname">Sensitivity</span>.</span>
                        <div class="itemgroup info">
                            <dl class="dl parml">
                                
                                    <dt class="dt pt dlterm"><a name="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-C93EB4C1-2B35-4912-9802-3CB8AF195290"><!-- --></a>Time Threshold</dt>

                                    <dd class="dd pd">
                                        <p class="p">The time an object loiter in the region. When the
                                            duration of the object in the defined detection area
                                            exceeds the threshold, the device will trigger an
                                            alarm.</p>

                                    </dd>

                                
                                
                                    <dt class="dt pt dlterm"><a name="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-FB85DF4E-43DD-4703-B048-496B323D5E8A"><!-- --></a>Sensitivity</dt>

                                    <dd class="dd pd">
                                        <p class="p">Sensitivity is the object size which is able to trigger
                                            an alarm. The higher the sensitivity is, the more easily
                                            the detection alarm will be triggered.</p>

                                    </dd>

                                
                            </dl>

                        </div>
                    </li>

                    <li class="li substep substepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-415D0FF7-6B92-4BC1-A4E5-394EE6EED639">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Click <span class="ph uicontrol">Draw Area</span>.</span>
                    </li>

                    <li class="li substep substepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-9FC6B236-0481-46AC-B3DC-B5B59312CA0D">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Draw a quadrilateral in the preview window.</span>
                    </li>

                </ol>

            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-0D7F3ABD-424B-4268-A1C0-640C21F69C87"><strong>Optional: </strong>
                <span class="ph cmd">Draw the maximum size/minimum size for targets.</span>
                <div class="itemgroup info">
                    <div class="note note" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-8AD4BDB9-8853-4C64-9EA9-2B24B29FCD9E"><span class="notetitle">Note:</span> 
                        <p class="p">Only the targets in the size ranging from maximum size to minimum size
                            will trigger Intrusion detection.</p>

                    </div>

                </div>
                <ol type="a" class="ol substeps" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__SUBSTEPS_DHL_TYN_CJB">
                    <li class="li substep" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-2281E04C-313C-40DB-8A0E-C791ABE1847A">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Click <span class="ph uicontrol">Max. Size</span>/<span class="ph uicontrol">Min.
                            Size</span>.</span>
                    </li>

                    <li class="li substep" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-D4A98772-F1DC-4C3D-86C1-87A53791159C">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Draw an area in preview window.</span>
                    </li>

                    <li class="li substep" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-0E1D3990-DCC6-409A-8C19-C2C554587D10">
                        <span class="ph cmd">Click <span class="ph uicontrol">Stop Drawing</span>.</span>
                    </li>

                </ol>

            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-AE715348-15BC-4B2A-867D-61D1CB8D6539"><strong>Optional: </strong>
                <span class="ph cmd">Select <span class="keyword parmname">Detection Target</span> as
                        <span class="ph uicontrol">Human</span> or <span class="ph uicontrol">Vehicle</span> to discard
                    alarms which are not triggered by human body or vehicle.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-B1E04F24-8413-4393-9575-D52217C2F7FD">
                <span class="ph cmd">Set the arming schedule. Refer to <a class="xref" href="GUID-B173C582-7B95-4DA9-9ADC-0D3C51EAAD79.html#GUID-B173C582-7B95-4DA9-9ADC-0D3C51EAAD79">Configure Arming Schedule</a>.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-37353C38-6496-4D23-AB8B-A0FB9F8CD83B">
                <span class="ph cmd">Set linkage actions. Refer to <a class="xref" href="GUID-7D76EB53-F6ED-467F-B08F-956A198A8E8B.html#GUID-7D76EB53-F6ED-467F-B08F-956A198A8E8B" title="Alarm linkage actions will be activated when an alarm or exception occurs.">Configure Linkage Actions</a>.</span>
            </li>
<li class="li step stepexpand" id="GUID-2D0716C7-6F01-434F-9190-3919E73979A2__GUID-0B69C976-2A17-4830-955C-EEDFE9DB6DCF">
                <span class="ph cmd">Click <span class="ph uicontrol">Apply</span>.</span>
            </li>
</ol>

</div>


</div>
							
							
							
						</div>
